    "Description": {
        "Id": "vehicledef_SCHILTRON_H1",
        "Name": "Schiltron H1",
        "Details": "Originally a refit developed in the periphery by \"Darkstalker Kagami\" as a means to replace damaged weapons in a captured Schiltron chassis.  The Schiltron H has actually seen widespread adoption by major mercenary commands that work in the periphery as a lower cost variant of the Schiltron.  Switching to twin Class 8 Howitzers, 2 10 tube Gyrojet launchers, with Reloaders and with two Medium Binary lasers as backup weapons, the Schiltron H was developed for combat at all ranges, both direct and in-direct.\n\n <b><color=#e51717>Pafftek Industries Sub-mod</color></b>",
